# Ambient fusion in the original symmetric-four wreath configuration

This source branch constructs the marked pair needed by 13.9.7–8 from the
original Sylow and maximal two-local subgroup. The normalizer argument uses
the four maximal elementary subgroups; Burnside fusion yields weak closure
and nonfusion, and the index-two centralizer then gives the actual Sylow pair.
-/
